@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F7F9FC
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #4A6FA5
title Input processing order (one input)
start
:Driver delivers sample\n(source ID, epoch, sample ID, timestamp, quality);
if (Driver reports Disconnected?) then (yes)
  #FFE5E5:Result = fault(Disconnected)\n(propagates immediately);
  stop
else (no)
endif
if (New physical sample?) then (no: duplicate / clock-only)
  :No filter or recovery contribution;\nfreshness not refreshed;
else (yes)
  if (Payload, unit and `valid` range OK?) then (no)
    #FFE5E5:Result = fault(Invalid);
    stop
  else (yes)
    :Update filter state;
  endif
endif
if (Filter ready and `recover_after` met?) then (no)
  #FFF4D6:Result = fault(NotReady);
  stop
else (yes)
endif
note right: Any fault clears the filter window;\nrecovery needs fresh valid samples.
if (Age of last valid sample < `stale_after`?) then (no)
  #FFE5E5:Result = fault(Stale);
  stop
else (yes)
  :Stateful predicate\n(hysteresis, debounce, ...);
  :Result = ok(value)\nwith quality preserved;
endif
stop
legend bottom
Every Result, ok or fault, reaches the author,
who chooses a control value with `case` or `recover`.
end legend
@enduml
